    "enUS": {
      "description": "Sifting through the loose dirt, the severed hand of an orc is found.  And clutched in the hand is a bone-carved tube.  And in the tube is a dirt-stained parchment.\n\nThe parchment is written in orcish... and it looks important.",
      "dialogue": {
        "4cd248a0753e77e39e56": "Do you have a report to make?",
        "a41fb23d2673bc90858a": "Hm... I can't read orcish very well, but this looks like a report... written by an orc spy!",
        "b1d8e4984495b4eedc5c": "Hm... I can't read orcish very well, but this looks like a report... written by an orc spy!",
        "f5ac280d9a9eb950366f": "Do you have a report to make?"
      },
      "summary": "Bring the Spy's Report to a Theramore Lieutenant.",
      "title": "The Orc Report",
